    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"single\"><ac:layout-cell><h2>Purpose and Benefits</h2><p>This guide helps the implementers to migrate the existing data that is maintained at a hospital prior to using Bahmni. &nbsp;The data could be patient information, relationship information, observations, forms, encounters, lab results, drugs and reference terms. &nbsp;The import is done using CSV files. This functionality is available as part of the Admin module which is available Out Of the Box with Bahmni. However the user needs to have &quot;app:admin&quot; privilege to be able to access it.</p><p><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"0ded1de5-e67b-454f-a3a3-4755a434acc7\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Sample CSV formats for Data Import</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p>You can see some sample import CSV file formats in github here:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Bahmni/banyan-config/tree/master/openmrs/referencedata\">https://github.com/Bahmni/banyan-config/tree/master/openmrs/referencedata</a></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"three_equal\"><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"4974efe8-3f41-4dc1-b6cb-12885fb0fd92\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\"> Implementation Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"children\" ac:schema-version=\"2\" ac:macro-id=\"ebb708dc-0fef-4681-8782-963185f9ad4e\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"all\">true</ac:parameter></ac:structured-macro></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"dcb22d66-6ab2-4302-95ab-f01893646185\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Feature Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Data Migration - Import\" ri:version-at-save=\"11\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Configure CSV Import - Feature Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"panel\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"85d3500b-789e-4df7-b3d9-ff24954802f7\"><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleColor\">white</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"titleBGColor\">#668D3C</ac:parameter><ac:parameter ac:name=\"title\">Usage Details</ac:parameter><ac:rich-text-body><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:link><ri:page ri:content-title=\"Import Data\" ri:version-at-save=\"6\" /><ac:plain-text-link-body><![CDATA[Configure CSV Import - User Guide]]></ac:plain-text-link-body></ac:link></span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p></ac:layout-cell></ac:layout-section></ac:layout>",
